## 6. Schema File (`schemas/core/{entity}.yml`)

```yaml
# Schema validation for core_{entity}.{entity}
columns:
  sk_core_{entity}:
    type: string
    required: true
  id_{entity}:
    type: string       # or bigint — match source type
    required: true
  # ... remaining business columns ...
  ts_load:
    type: timestamp
    required: true
  year:
    type: int
    required: true
  month:
    type: int
    required: true
  day:
    type: int
    required: true

min_columns: N    # set to exact column count
max_columns: N
strict: true
```

